  "_readme": [
    "THE RESOLUTION KEY. Hand-edited: this is the only file that says what actually happened.",
    "Fill a `value` in as each outcome settles and the whole site recomputes from it.",
    "",
    "  value      the outcome. A team name or 3-letter id for team questions, a full",
    "             person name for person questions, an integer for sb_points.",
    "             Leave null while it is still undecided \u2014 null renders as PENDING",
    "             everywhere and is excluded from every denominator, never as wrong.",
    "  team       the franchise the outcome belongs to. Set it on coach questions so",
    "             an entrant who answered 'Panthers coach' or 'Arizona' grades",
    "             correctly; on team questions it is filled in automatically.",
    "  resolvedAt ISO date the outcome became official. Shown next to the result.",
    "  source     free-text note, e.g. 'AP awards, 2027-02-05'.",
    "  void       set true only if a question can never resolve (no coach was fired",
    "             all season). A void question drops out instead of scoring zero.",
    "",
    "Dark Horse MVP has no entry here on purpose: it is graded against `mvp`."
  ],
